          %h3#on_modules_as_stabilized_overcategories On modules as stabilized overcategories
          %p
            The observation that the category of modules over a ring
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi R
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} R
            is equivalent to the category of abelian group objects in the overcategory
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi CRing
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                  %mi R
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} CRing/R
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Beck+module"}> Beck module
            ) is due to
          %ul
